#: ../fhir-harness/processes/content/ig-ast-cache.bpmn:80
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Read the size report the build printed before its push, and fix what it shows, or raise a decision card with the owner when no known fix applies (skill `ig-publication` §\"Size review\"). The report is cat-harness-tools `site-size.ts` (`bun run cat site:size`), written as `site-size.json` beside the build, never into the site. It gives the total against the published `gh-pages` root, the top directories, the size by extension, the biggest files, byte-identical duplicates, source maps, the directories named after another layer of `index.lock.json`, and the directories the shared-assets host could serve. Growth over the budget (10% or 10 MB) is a warning. The review is advisory and never refuses a publish."
msgstr ""

